<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

    <head>

        <%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy - ImgToolkit'
        }) %>

    </head>

    <body>

        <%- include('partials/header') %>

        <section class="hero">

            <div class="wrap">

                <span class="eyebrow">
                    LEGAL
                </span>

                <h1>
                    Privacy<br>
                    <em>Policy</em>
                </h1>

                <p class="sub">
                    Your privacy matters. This page explains exactly what data
                    ImgToolkit collects, what it doesn't, and how your uploaded
                    files are handled.
                </p>

                <p class="sub" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;">
                    Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
                    day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %>
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <div class="sprocket-divider">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            <div class="line"></div>
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>

        <section class="wrap">

            <div class="about-box">

                <h2>1. The Short Version</h2>
                <p>
                    ImgToolkit does not require an account, does not track you
                    personally, and deletes every uploaded file immediately
                    after processing. We only keep anonymous, non-identifying
                    usage statistics (which tool was used, file size, timestamp)
                    — never the content of your files.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>2. What We Collect</h2>
                <p>We collect the minimum needed to run the Service:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>✔ <strong>Uploaded files</strong> — held only in
                        temporary server storage during processing, then deleted
                        automatically.</li>
                    <li>✔ <strong>Anonymous usage logs</strong> — which tool was
                        used, original/result file size, and timestamp. No
                        filename content, no account, no personal identifier is
                        attached to this.</li>
                    <li>✔ <strong>Standard server logs</strong> — basic
                        technical request logs (e.g. for debugging errors), kept
                        only briefly and not used to identify individuals.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>3. What We Do NOT Collect</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>✔ No account, name, or email address (the Service works
                        entirely without sign-up).</li>
                    <li>✔ No permanent storage or backup of your uploaded or
                        processed files.</li>
                    <li>✔ No selling or sharing of any data with advertisers or
                        third parties.</li>
                    <li>✔ No tracking cookies used to profile you across other
                        websites.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>4. How Your Files Are Handled</h2>
                <p>
                    When you upload a file, it is sent securely to our server,
                    processed by the selected tool (for example, compressed or
                    converted), and streamed back to you as a download. Both the
                    original upload and the processed result are deleted from
                    our server immediately after the response is delivered —
                    normally within seconds. We do not open, review, or scan the
                    content of your files for any purpose beyond the processing
                    you requested.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
                <p>
                    ImgToolkit runs on infrastructure provided by third-party
                    hosting and database providers (such as Render for hosting
                    and MongoDB Atlas for the anonymous usage log). These
                    providers may process technical data (like IP addresses,
                    purely for routing/security at the infrastructure level) as
                    part of standard hosting operations, governed by their own
                    privacy policies. We do not instruct these providers to
                    store or inspect your file content.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
                <p>
                    ImgToolkit does not use tracking or advertising cookies. Any
                    cookies used are strictly limited to essential technical
                    functionality (if any), and never used to build an
                    advertising profile of you.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
                <p>
                    The Service is not directed at children under 13, and we do
                    not knowingly collect personal information from children.
                    Since no account or personal information is required to use
                    the Service, this risk is minimal by design.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>
                    Because we don't store personal data or file content beyond
                    the brief processing window, there is generally nothing tied
                    to you to access, correct, or delete. If you have any
                    concern about a specific interaction with the Service,
                    you're welcome to contact us and we'll look into it.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                <p>
                    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to
                    reflect changes in the Service. Any changes will be posted
                    on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="about-box" style="margin-top:20px;">

                <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how
                    your data is handled, please reach out via our <a
                        href="/contact" style="color:var(--amber);">Contact
                        page</a>.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <section class="wrap">

            <div class="cta-box">

                <h2>
                    Ready to get started?
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Explore all 16 tools — free, no account needed.
                </p>

                <a href="/" class="run-btn">
                    Explore Tools
                </a>

            </div>

        </section>

        <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    </body>

</html>